required_changes.change:
Keep the fold row's accessible name equal to its visible words in every state (WCAG 2.5.3 Label in Name), and keep the APG Disclosure structure:
- a native summary as the only control in the row;
- the cloned face without aria-hidden, but its link glyph still aria-hidden;
- no role or tabindex on the chip;
- Change a sibling of the summary, never inside it.
